        <mxCell id="steps" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;Data Mesh Flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;① DMS replicates RDS data to S3 lake&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;② Kinesis streams real-time data to S3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;③ Glue ETL transforms and curates data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;④ Producer publishes data product to DataZone&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑤ DataZone manages catalog &amp;amp; governance via Lake Formation&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑥ Consumer subscribes to data product&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;⑦ Consumer queries via Athena, Redshift, SageMaker" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#E0E0E0;fontSize=12;spacing=10;arcSize=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
